\section{Experiments}
\label{sec:experiments}

We test the race on linear JEPAs (E1, development; E1b, held out), on masking (E2) and on a ViT (E3); E1b--E3 were pre-registered.
E1 trains the population loss \eqref{eq:loss} by full-batch gradient descent with $\Pred_0=p_0I$ and $\lambda_W=\lambda_P=\lambda$ over grids in $\lambda$, $p_0$, $\alpha$, $a_0$, $\kappa$ and $L$ (\EoneRuns{} runs; \cref{app:details}).
The rank counts singular values of $\Wc$ above \EoneSvThr{}; the baselines are the initial window $\#\{k:g_k(p_0)>0\}$ and the static bound $\#\{k:c_k^2\ge4\lambda\sigma_k\}$; brackets are bootstrap 95\% intervals.

